          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A good room humidifier typically costs $40 to $100. In that range you can get a top-fill tank, a built-in humidistat and enough output for a bedroom or living room. Spending more mostly buys smart features, premium materials or larger capacity, while spending less usually means a smaller tank, no humidistat and a harder tank to clean."
          }
