            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For three or more rooms, a bypass or fan-powered whole-house unit is usually competitive on cost and far less work, since there are no tanks to fill or clean. Several warm mist units cost more to run than a bypass system, while several ultrasonic units on tap water can cost less but require daily refilling."
          }
        }
